## 6. Permission requests

No request is needed for the ordinary app use expressly allowed by section 2.1.
For activities requiring separate permission under section 2.2, follow this
request process:

Contact the repository owner, ZHINFINITY, through the contact channels listed
at https://github.com/ZHINFINITY. Identify the exact source revision or files,
your intended activities, how and where you will distribute them, and whether
you intend commercial use or monetization. Do not include private information
in a public issue. Wait for an express written grant before proceeding.

